<section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Admissions enquiries</h2><p>SWEEP Schools includes SWEEP Kidz Pre-School and SWEEP Academy Primary School. An enquiry is the first step in learning more about the school and its current admissions process; it does not constitute an application or guarantee a place.</p><h2>What to ask the school</h2><ul><li>Which age group or grade is appropriate for your child?</li><li>Whether places are currently available.</li><li>Which application forms and supporting documents are required.</li><li>Current fees, payment arrangements and any additional costs.</li><li>Whether a school visit or meeting can be arranged.</li></ul><div class="fee-notice"><strong>Before you apply:</strong> Admissions requirements, availability and documentation must be confirmed directly with the school. No application submission system is connected in this preview.</div><h2>Contact the school</h2><p>You can contact the school by telephone or email. Please do not email sensitive identity or learner documents until the school confirms a secure submission method.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za?subject=SWEEP%20Schools%20Admissions%20Enquiry">Email an enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="tel:+27116805938">Call the school</a></div></div><aside class="info-card"><h3>Admissions contact</h3><p><strong>Telephone</strong><br /><a href="tel:+27116805938">011 680 5938</a></p><p><strong>Email</strong><br /><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za">schools@sweeplife.co.za</a></p><p><strong>Address</strong><br />4 Burger Street, corner Burger and Swartgoud Streets, Suideroord, Johannesburg, 2091</p><p class="muted">These details are from the public website and must be reconfirmed before launch.</p></aside></div></section>
